The CORS errors in your screenshot happen because your app is trying to load its JavaScript and CSS files from github.com instead of your live website address github.io.

This means there is a typo in your vite.config.js file or your deployment configuration.

How to Fix It
-----------------

1) Open your vite.config.js file.

2) Check your base path property. You likely have github.com written in it instead of just the repository name.

3) Update the base property so it only contains your repository name wrapped in forward slashes:

javascriptexport default defineConfig({
  plugins: [react()],
  base: '/ReactProjectToggle/', // Ensure it matches your repository name exactly
})


